        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"thumbs up\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44d\" role=\"img\" title=\"thumbs up\">:thumbs_up:</span> alexcrichton submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14450#pullrequestreview-5358497547\">PR review</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>On one hand I'm a bit hesitant of the increase in verbosity here, but on the other hand it's pretty easy to read and understand what things are doing. My main musing here I think is whether original panicking methods should be outright deleted/changed instead of growing sibling fallible versions</p>\n</blockquote>",
